---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="projects" title="Project Events" active="project-events" pageMark="🏗️">
  The decisions that appear when a city finishes a production <strong>Project</strong>. There are two
  kinds. A <strong>one-time building project</strong>, such as the
  <a href={`${base}urban-improvements`}>Archive</a>, Forum, Walls, Treasury, Sangam or Opulence, fires
  one specific decision, much as a <a href={`${base}wonder-events`}>wonder event</a> does. A
  <strong>repeatable project</strong>, meaning the Festival, Hunt and Olympiad, rolls one story from a
  weighted pool every time you run it, and the Festival draws on the largest pool. Each card shows what
  triggers it and what every choice grants. A weight is the value in the XML rather than a real in-game
  chance, because character and empire conditions filter which stories are eligible.
</EventGroupPage>
